sts{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-10T10:35:56Z","updated_at":"2025-06-10T10:35:56Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2958594525/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2962097322","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107211#issuecomment-2962097322","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107211","id":2962097322,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wjgSq","user":{"login":"lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-11T10:21:27Z","updated_at":"2025-06-11T10:21:27Z","body":"Hey, I noticed something when resolving a merge conflict in another PR.\r\n\r\nThe code in resource_importer_scene.cpp line 1583 within `ResourceImporterScene::_post_fix_node` now has 3 if statements\r\n```\r\nif (!mat_id.is_empty() && p_material_data.has(mat_id)) {\r\n...\r\n}\r\nif (!mat_id.is_empty() && extract_mat != 0) { // ADDED BY THIS PR\r\n.... some code uses p_material_data[mat_id]\r\n}\r\nif (!mat_id.is_empty() && p_material_data.has(mat_id)) {\r\n...\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nNotice how the new if statement uses `p_material_data[mat_id]` despite not checking if `p_material_data.has(mat_id)` - I don't personally know if this condition is possible, but should we add the .has() check? (can it cause a crash if indexing into a dictionary without the key being there)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2962097322/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2962122548","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107211#issuecomment-2962122548","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107211","id":2962122548,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6wjmc0","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-11T10:28:34Z","updated_at":"2025-06-11T10:30:06Z","body":"> Notice how the new if statement uses p_material_data[mat_id] despite not checking if p_material_data.has(mat_id) - I don't personally know if this condition is possible\r\n\r\nThis condition is almost always true, it's getting writable `maddata` reference, so if it is not in the map (this is the case when all values are default) a new one will be created, and it will be able to write exported paths.\r\n\r\nOther two ifs only do stuff if it already exists.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2962122548/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3742593099","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107211#issuecomment-3742593099","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107211","id":3742593099,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7fE3BL","user":{"login":"Zireael07","id":4525388,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MjUzODg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4525388?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07","html_url":"https://github.com/Zireael07","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zireael07/gists{/gist_id}","st